        <mxCell id="c102" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#555A65&quot;&gt;What the PC owner does with Dyno. Everything that changes the machine needs an enabled rule or an explicit click, and is undoable where the OS allows (ADR 0006). Dashed ellipses are planned.&lt;/span&gt;" style="fontFamily=Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#17181C;fontSize=11;text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="82" width="1500" height="32" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
